WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.133
Our Heroes are on their way to Cyllage City,

2
00:00:06.199 --> 00:00:09.566
site of Ash’s next Kalos Gym battle.

3
00:00:09.633 --> 00:00:12.100
Want some more, Dedenne?

4
00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:17.533
Bonnie, it isn’t a good idea to give Dedenne so many snacks at once.

5
00:00:17.599 --> 00:00:19.433
Huh? Why isn’t it?

6
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:22.433
Because when mealtime rolls around, it won’t be hungry.

7
00:00:22.500 --> 00:00:24.966
Pokémon food is specially formulated

8
00:00:25.033 --> 00:00:27.433
to give Pokémon a healthy, well-balanced diet.

9
00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:31.133
So it’s better to eat at a specific time on a regular basis.

10
00:00:31.200 --> 00:00:34.966
So I guess it’s better not to give Dedenne any snacks at all.

11
00:00:35.033 --> 00:00:37.333
Huh? At all?

12
00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:40.766
Hold on. I’m sure a little bit is okay.

13
00:00:40.833 --> 00:00:44.699
He’s right. I give Pikachu snacks, but when it’s time to eat a meal,

14
00:00:44.766 --> 00:00:46.766
- both of us are always hungry.
- Pika!

15
00:00:46.833 --> 00:00:50.266
Well, that’s because the two of you like to eat a ton of food.

16
00:00:50.333 --> 00:00:53.166
You sure know a lot about Pokémon, don’t you, Clemont?

17
00:00:53.233 --> 00:00:54.699
- Huh?
- Sure he does.

18
00:00:54.766 --> 00:00:58.133
Remember, he’s the Lumiose Gym Leader, although he doesn’t look like it.

19
00:00:58.199 --> 00:01:00.099
Doesn’t look like it?

20
00:01:00.166 --> 00:01:04.566
There’s a lot more I need to learn about being a Trainer, for Fennekin and me.

21
00:01:04.633 --> 00:01:06.266
- Fen!
- Right.

22
00:01:06.333 --> 00:01:09.700
Part of being a good Trainer is managing your Pokémon’s health.

23
00:01:09.766 --> 00:01:12.899
- You feel healthy, right, buddy?
- Pika! Pika!

24
00:01:12.966 --> 00:01:17.066
I have an idea. Let’s take a break. The next town shouldn’t be far away.

25
00:01:17.133 --> 00:01:20.133
Sure. Once we get there, you want to stop at the Pokémon Center?

26
00:01:20.200 --> 00:01:21.700
- Pika!
- Yay!

27
00:01:21.766 --> 00:01:24.433
Hear that, Dedenne? Dedenne?

28
00:01:24.500 --> 00:01:27.300
Dedenne disappeared!

29
00:01:27.366 --> 00:01:29.933
- Huh?
- No way.

30
00:01:30.000 --> 00:01:32.833
♪ I want to be the very best ♪

31
00:01:32.899 --> 00:01:36.266
♪ Like no one ever was ♪

32
00:01:36.333 --> 00:01:39.066
♪ To catch them is my real test ♪

33
00:01:39.133 --> 00:01:42.233
♪ To train them is my cause ♪

34
00:01:42.300 --> 00:01:45.300
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all It's you and me ♪

35
00:01:45.366 --> 00:01:48.500
♪ Pokémon! I know it's my destiny ♪

36
00:01:48.566 --> 00:01:51.933
♪ Pokémon! Yeah, you're my best friend ♪

37
00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:54.366
♪ In a world we must defend ♪

38
00:01:54.433 --> 00:01:56.866
♪ Pokémon! Got to catch them all ♪

39
00:01:56.933 --> 00:01:59.933
♪ Got to catch them all! Pokémon ♪

40
00:02:09.033 --> 00:02:13.433
- Dedenne?
- Hey! Dedenne. Where did you go?

41
00:02:13.500 --> 00:02:14.733
Pika!

42
00:02:14.799 --> 00:02:17.366
- Dedenne!
- Dedenne!

43
00:02:17.433 --> 00:02:22.333
- Where are you, Dedenne? Hello?
- Dedenne!

44
00:02:22.400 --> 00:02:24.533
Oh!

45
00:02:24.600 --> 00:02:27.033
-What’s wrong, Serena?

46
00:02:27.100 --> 00:02:29.033
- Over there.
- Huh?

47
00:02:29.100 --> 00:02:30.833
Dedenne!

48
00:02:30.900 --> 00:02:32.733
I get it.

49
00:02:34.333 --> 00:02:36.000
Dedenne wanted berries.

50
00:02:36.066 --> 00:02:38.233
Its stomach is like a bottomless pit.

51
00:02:38.299 --> 00:02:40.133
Pika!

52
00:02:40.200 --> 00:02:43.766
Come on, Dedenne, you know you shouldn’t have run off like that.

53
00:02:51.033 --> 00:02:55.133
-Huh?

54
00:02:58.933 --> 00:03:01.299
- Hey, Pikachu!
- Pika! Pi!

55
00:03:03.566 --> 00:03:06.000
Your Pokémon are all in great health.

56
00:03:06.066 --> 00:03:08.566
- Thanks a lot.

57
00:03:08.633 --> 00:03:11.233
- Wow, that’s great.
- Pika.

58
00:03:11.299 --> 00:03:13.299
Thanks for your help.

59
00:03:15.433 --> 00:03:17.533
- Excuse me, Miss.
- Hm?

60
00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:20.733
Will you please take care of my brother? You’re a keeper!

61
00:03:20.799 --> 00:03:23.899
Oh! I told you to stop this a million times!

62
00:03:23.966 --> 00:03:27.500
He may not look like it, but he’s actually a Gym Leader.

63
00:03:27.566 --> 00:03:31.233
He’s got a great future ahead of him, but I can’t look after him forever.

64
00:03:31.299 --> 00:03:33.533
- He needs a dependable wife!
- Huh?

65
00:03:33.600 --> 00:03:36.133
Think about it, please! Oh!

66
00:03:36.200 --> 00:03:39.266
This is so embarrassing. Why do you do this?

67
00:03:39.333 --> 00:03:42.166
Duh! Because you’re my big brother and I care about you.

68
00:03:42.233 --> 00:03:44.399
Care about me by minding your own business.

69
00:03:44.466 --> 00:03:46.866
- Thanks for waiting, Lyn.
- No prob.

70
00:03:46.933 --> 00:03:49.133
- Are you ready to go?
- I'm ready, Lena.

71
00:03:49.200 --> 00:03:53.033
From now on, I’ll take care of myself, okay? Do you understand me?

72
00:03:53.100 --> 00:03:57.333
Hey! Now that everybody’s feeling good, why don’t we have a battle?

73
00:03:57.399 --> 00:03:59.100
Yeah. That’s a great idea.

74
00:03:59.166 --> 00:04:01.533
I think I saw a battlefield right out there.

75
00:04:01.600 --> 00:04:04.066
- Let’s go.
- Pika.

76
00:04:04.133 --> 00:04:06.299
Huh? Wait for me.

77
00:04:10.733 --> 00:04:12.566
Good luck, both of you.

78
00:04:12.633 --> 00:04:15.166
Pikachu and Chespin, good luck to you too.

79
00:04:15.233 --> 00:04:17.366
All right, Chespin, Tackle, go!

80
00:04:17.433 --> 00:04:20.133
Okay, Pikachu, use Iron Tail.

81
00:04:20.200 --> 00:04:24.300
Pikachu! Pika!

82
00:04:24.366 --> 00:04:28.266
Che!

83
00:04:28.333 --> 00:04:30.233
- Chespin, you okay?
- Chespin!

84
00:04:30.300 --> 00:04:33.200
There’s no way we’re going to lose this, Chespin.

85
00:04:33.266 --> 00:04:35.933
- Use Vine Whip!
- Ches!

86
00:04:36.000 --> 00:04:38.366
Pikachu. Dodge it, quick!

87
00:04:39.666 --> 00:04:43.166
They’re both moving so well. It’s because they saw Nurse Joy.

88
00:04:43.233 --> 00:04:45.400
Huh? Mm?

89
00:04:45.466 --> 00:04:47.933
- What’s that?
- Is something wrong?

90
00:04:48.000 --> 00:04:51.066
Those don’t look like Dedenne’s ears to me.

91
00:04:51.133 --> 00:04:54.266
No, they sure don’t. I wonder...

92
00:04:54.333 --> 00:04:55.533
Pika!

93
00:04:55.599 --> 00:04:57.900
-Pika?

94
00:04:57.966 --> 00:05:00.433
- Oh!
- Who’s that Pokémon?

95
00:05:00.500 --> 00:05:02.966
- Huh?

96
00:05:03.033 --> 00:05:05.133
Pi...

97
00:05:05.200 --> 00:05:06.366
Chu!

98
00:05:06.433 --> 00:05:09.533
Bonnie, look out.

99
00:05:09.599 --> 00:05:12.099
- What was that?
- Huh? Bonnie’s over there.

100
00:05:16.466 --> 00:05:20.133
- Are you okay?
- What happened?

101
00:05:20.200 --> 00:05:23.333
That Pokémon. It was in Bonnie’s bag.

102
00:05:27.000 --> 00:05:29.700
- Pichu.
- We’ve got to stop it somehow.

103
00:05:29.766 --> 00:05:31.233
Pikachu, use Thunderbolt.

104
00:05:31.300 --> 00:05:33.900
Pikachu!

105
00:05:36.566 --> 00:05:38.066
Pichu.

106
00:05:38.133 --> 00:05:40.266
Pi! Pi!

107
00:05:40.333 --> 00:05:42.766
You okay?

108
00:05:42.833 --> 00:05:44.766
- Pika! Pika!
- Pichu.

109
00:05:44.833 --> 00:05:47.333
It looks like Pichu’s settling down.

110
00:05:47.400 --> 00:05:51.800
What a total surprise and what a totally cute Pokémon.

111
00:05:51.866 --> 00:05:53.866
Pichu, the Tiny Mouse Pokémon.

112
00:05:53.933 --> 00:05:56.466
The electric sacs on Pichu’s cheeks are small.

113
00:05:56.533 --> 00:06:00.566
If it tries to store more electricity than they can hold, Pichu will shock itself.

114
00:06:00.633 --> 00:06:03.766
Pichu can evolve into Pikachu, isn’t that right?

115
00:06:03.833 --> 00:06:06.000
- Right.
- Pika! Pika!

116
00:06:06.066 --> 00:06:07.233
Pichu!

117
00:06:07.300 --> 00:06:11.500
But, how in the world did that Pichu manage to end up inside of your bag?

118
00:06:11.566 --> 00:06:15.433
Dedenne! Where’s Dedenne?

119
00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:18.033
Oh! This isn’t my bag!

120
00:06:18.099 --> 00:06:19.733
- What? Not your bag?
- Huh.

121
00:06:20.900 --> 00:06:24.000
Huh?

122
00:06:25.466 --> 00:06:28.200
This is it. This is where I put my bag.

123
00:06:28.266 --> 00:06:31.933
I guess it’s possible that somebody else took your bag by mistake.

124
00:06:32.000 --> 00:06:34.299
Well, if that’s the case, we need to find them.

125
00:06:34.366 --> 00:06:37.233
Don’t worry. We’ll just ask Nurse Joy. She’ll help.

126
00:06:37.299 --> 00:06:38.766
Pika.

127
00:06:40.566 --> 00:06:43.033
There was a little girl with a similar bag

128
00:06:43.099 --> 00:06:44.533
who was with her older sister,

129
00:06:44.599 --> 00:06:47.000
who happens to be a Trainer.

130
00:06:47.066 --> 00:06:50.133
Then that’s it. Do you remember what the little girl looked like?

131
00:06:50.200 --> 00:06:54.900
Let me see. Oh! I remember she wore a red ribbon in her hair.

132
00:06:54.966 --> 00:06:59.666
Red, huh? Okay. They couldn’t have gone too far. Let’s go look.

133
00:06:59.733 --> 00:07:01.200
- Okay.
- Pika.

134
00:07:01.266 --> 00:07:05.933
It’s my fault for not paying more attention. Huh?

135
00:07:06.000 --> 00:07:08.533
Now, don’t worry. We’ll find Dedenne.

136
00:07:08.599 --> 00:07:09.733
Okay.

137
00:07:09.799 --> 00:07:13.299
And, Pichu, we’ll definitely find your Trainer. I promise.

138
00:07:13.366 --> 00:07:14.866
Pikachu.

139
00:07:14.933 --> 00:07:16.233
Pichu.

140
00:07:17.366 --> 00:07:21.233
A Lilligant. Lena, it’s so cute.

141
00:07:21.299 --> 00:07:23.066
- Wow!
- It is.

142
00:07:23.133 --> 00:07:25.133
Careful. Move back.

143
00:07:27.566 --> 00:07:29.866
You really love Pokémon, don’t you, Lyn?

144
00:07:29.933 --> 00:07:33.599
Yeah. I want to become a Trainer just like you when I get older,

145
00:07:33.666 --> 00:07:38.000
so until then, I’m going to take really good care of this little Pichu.

146
00:07:38.066 --> 00:07:40.533
I think that’s a wonderful idea.

147
00:07:41.533 --> 00:07:43.333
Huh? Is that you, Lena?

148
00:07:44.466 --> 00:07:47.833
What do you know? I had no idea you were in town.

149
00:07:47.900 --> 00:07:50.599
I was just on my way to challenge my next Gym.

150
00:07:50.666 --> 00:07:54.333
- Oh, which one is that?
- I'm headed to the Cyllage City Gym.

151
00:07:54.400 --> 00:07:59.533
- Huh? Huh? Pichu, are you awake?
- Ne? Ne?

152
00:07:59.599 --> 00:08:01.566
Huh? You aren't Pichu.

153
00:08:01.633 --> 00:08:04.233
- Ne?
- Huh?

154
00:08:04.299 --> 00:08:08.166
- I’m so glad you’re doing well.
- You, too, Lena.

155
00:08:08.233 --> 00:08:11.000
- Well, I guess it’s time I got going.
- Okay.

156
00:08:11.066 --> 00:08:14.433
And let’s have another battle again sometime, okay, see you later.

157
00:08:14.500 --> 00:08:16.266
Sure. I’ll be looking forward to it.

158
00:08:16.333 --> 00:08:22.333
Lyn, I’m sorry to make you wait. Huh? Lyn? Oh!

159
00:08:22.400 --> 00:08:26.799
Where are you, Lyn? Lyn? Lyn?

160
00:08:26.866 --> 00:08:31.266
Where’d you come from? And where’s my friend Pichu?

161
00:08:31.333 --> 00:08:34.000
- Ne! Ne!
- What happened?

162
00:08:34.066 --> 00:08:37.833
I was supposed to take care of Pichu for Lena. What should I do?

163
00:08:42.366 --> 00:08:45.733
Excuse me. Have you seen a little girl with a red ribbon in her hair?

164
00:08:45.800 --> 00:08:49.600
- We’ve got to find her.
- Huh. Huh! Hmm.

165
00:08:49.666 --> 00:08:51.300
Hey look, Ash. There!

166
00:08:51.366 --> 00:08:55.766
- A ribbon.
- Wait. Hey, you!

167
00:08:58.900 --> 00:09:01.900
- Excuse me. Please let us through!
- Pika!

168
00:09:01.966 --> 00:09:04.366
- Wait, mister.
- We’re going to lose him.

169
00:09:05.966 --> 00:09:08.900
We need to talk to that girl with the ribbon!

170
00:09:08.966 --> 00:09:10.300
-Oh!

171
00:09:10.366 --> 00:09:11.966
Mister!

172
00:09:12.033 --> 00:09:14.566
Who’s that Pokémon?

173
00:09:19.033 --> 00:09:21.033
It's Pichu.

174
00:09:25.733 --> 00:09:27.966
Wait.

175
00:09:30.100 --> 00:09:33.566
Can I help you with something? It’s a present.

176
00:09:33.633 --> 00:09:36.433
- Oh, no.
- I’m sorry.

177
00:09:36.500 --> 00:09:40.900
- We confused you with someone else.
- It’s quite all right.

178
00:09:43.033 --> 00:09:45.033
I really thought we’d found her.

179
00:09:45.100 --> 00:09:47.800
It feels like we’ve looked everywhere around here.

180
00:09:47.866 --> 00:09:49.600
Maybe she didn’t come this way.

181
00:09:49.666 --> 00:09:52.800
Nurse Joy said she was with her older sister who’s a Trainer,

182
00:09:52.866 --> 00:09:55.400
so they might already be on their way to the next town.

183
00:09:55.466 --> 00:09:58.266
They can’t! What about Dedenne?

184
00:09:58.333 --> 00:10:02.433
It’s possible the little girl hasn’t even noticed she took the wrong bag yet.

185
00:10:02.500 --> 00:10:05.633
I’m certain she’ll come back when she discovers what happened.

186
00:10:05.699 --> 00:10:08.300
Don’t forget Nurse Joy told us she’d let us know

187
00:10:08.366 --> 00:10:10.900
when the little girl comes back, so we should be okay.

188
00:10:10.966 --> 00:10:13.500
She’s right. There’s no way they’d go somewhere else

189
00:10:13.566 --> 00:10:15.866
and leave their cute little Pichu behind.

190
00:10:15.933 --> 00:10:18.466
- Pichu.
- Pikachu.

191
00:10:18.533 --> 00:10:20.166
Now, don’t cry, please?

192
00:10:20.233 --> 00:10:23.166
We’ll get you safely back to your Trainer for sure.

193
00:10:23.233 --> 00:10:25.600
- Pichu?
- Mm-hm!

194
00:10:25.666 --> 00:10:28.066
Pichu!

195
00:10:32.633 --> 00:10:36.300
I can’t figure out how something like this could have happened.

196
00:10:37.600 --> 00:10:40.466
Do you have any idea what happened to your Trainer?

197
00:10:40.533 --> 00:10:42.566
Huh! Huh? Oh, no!

198
00:10:44.633 --> 00:10:47.100
I don’t see that little one anywhere.

199
00:10:47.166 --> 00:10:51.866
There it is! Hey! What’s going on?

200
00:10:51.933 --> 00:10:53.199
Na-na-na-na!

201
00:10:53.266 --> 00:10:55.033
Huh?

202
00:10:55.100 --> 00:10:58.766
I get it. You want to have a donut, don’t you?

203
00:11:00.333 --> 00:11:05.033
I like donuts too. Uh, excuse me.

204
00:11:05.100 --> 00:11:07.266
- May I get a donut please?
- Na-na-na!

205
00:11:07.333 --> 00:11:11.000
I was wondering if you’ve seen a little girl with a red ribbon in her hair.

206
00:11:11.066 --> 00:11:12.366
No. Sorry.

207
00:11:14.533 --> 00:11:15.866
Okay, thanks.

208
00:11:17.800 --> 00:11:19.600
Huh? Thanks.

209
00:11:19.666 --> 00:11:24.066
Hey! A woman told me she saw a little girl with a ribbon in her hair in the park.

210
00:11:25.266 --> 00:11:27.199
Here.

211
00:11:27.266 --> 00:11:30.199
Dedenne!

212
00:11:32.766 --> 00:11:37.100
Hmm.

213
00:11:37.166 --> 00:11:41.199
It’s yummy. Mm! Mm!

214
00:11:42.733 --> 00:11:44.733
Na!

215
00:11:44.800 --> 00:11:46.300
I know.

216
00:11:46.366 --> 00:11:47.900
Na!

217
00:11:49.133 --> 00:11:51.966
Hm. Now, you stay still while I put this on you, okay?

218
00:11:52.033 --> 00:11:53.066
Na-na!

219
00:11:53.133 --> 00:11:55.000
Hmm.

220
00:11:56.033 --> 00:11:58.566
So cute!

221
00:11:59.600 --> 00:12:03.933
You see? Now we’re a match.

222
00:12:06.033 --> 00:12:10.433
Pichu’s really cute and I care about it a whole bunch, but I like you, too.

223
00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:12.866
- Want to come home with me?
- Na-na.

224
00:12:12.933 --> 00:12:17.033
Wait. I’m sure your Trainer’s got to be looking for you right now.

225
00:12:17.100 --> 00:12:18.866
Really worried, too.

226
00:12:18.933 --> 00:12:22.433
Hey. If I go back to the Pokémon Center and bring you with me,

227
00:12:22.500 --> 00:12:25.733
maybe I’ll find Pichu there. Hmm. Let’s go back.

228
00:12:31.733 --> 00:12:35.233
This is it. The woman said she saw the little girl right around here.

229
00:12:35.300 --> 00:12:37.466
Looks like she already left.

230
00:12:37.533 --> 00:12:41.733
I’m afraid at this rate, we’ll never be able to find her.

231
00:12:41.800 --> 00:12:44.733
I just thought of something, but I need some time.

232
00:12:44.800 --> 00:12:47.966
Hm? It sounds like you’ve got an idea.

233
00:12:48.033 --> 00:12:49.533
Yeah.

234
00:12:49.599 --> 00:12:52.733
There’s something I want to try that might just do the trick.

235
00:12:55.533 --> 00:12:58.533
I wonder if Pichu’s Trainer noticed what happened yet.

236
00:12:58.599 --> 00:13:01.033
I sure hope we find Dedenne soon.

237
00:13:06.333 --> 00:13:08.466
Huh?

238
00:13:08.533 --> 00:13:11.633
- Pikachu!
- Pi?

239
00:13:17.866 --> 00:13:19.633
Pikachu!

240
00:13:19.699 --> 00:13:21.699
Pichu!

241
00:13:26.199 --> 00:13:28.633
They look like they’re from the same family.

242
00:13:28.699 --> 00:13:32.199
Wow, they do, don’t they? Bonnie, don’t you think?

243
00:13:32.266 --> 00:13:34.933
Hmm?

244
00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:38.466
Don’t worry, Bonnie. We’ll find Dedenne soon.

245
00:13:40.599 --> 00:13:42.900
Chu! Pichu!

246
00:13:42.966 --> 00:13:45.133
- Thanks, Pichu, ha!
- Pichu!

247
00:13:51.900 --> 00:13:56.400
I’m not sure which way to go to get to the Pokémon Center. Hm.

248
00:14:01.933 --> 00:14:03.866
Huh? Gone again!

249
00:14:03.933 --> 00:14:10.066
I can’t believe it would keep running off. Where are you?

250
00:14:13.866 --> 00:14:17.699
Huh? There you are!

251
00:14:20.900 --> 00:14:23.766
I’m glad I put that ribbon on you.

252
00:14:25.699 --> 00:14:28.833
Aw. I can only imagine the things you put your Trainer through,

253
00:14:28.900 --> 00:14:30.300
with all of your games.

254
00:14:30.366 --> 00:14:32.666
Hmm. Thanks for your patience.

255
00:14:32.733 --> 00:14:35.400
The future is now, thanks to science.

256
00:14:35.466 --> 00:14:38.333
Clemontic Gear on!

257
00:14:38.400 --> 00:14:41.766
Here’s my revolutionary invention that will solve the problem at hand.

258
00:14:41.833 --> 00:14:44.433
It’s the radio wave amplification device.

259
00:14:44.500 --> 00:14:46.400
- Radio wave?
- Ampli...?

260
00:14:46.466 --> 00:14:48.566
- Uh, device?
- Pikachu?

261
00:14:48.633 --> 00:14:50.566
Allow me to explain.

262
00:14:50.633 --> 00:14:55.033
If you recall, Dedenne is able to sense Pikachu’s electricity.

263
00:14:55.099 --> 00:14:59.400
This converts Pikachu’s electricity into radio waves and amplifies them.

264
00:14:59.466 --> 00:15:01.199
If we broadcast those waves,

265
00:15:01.266 --> 00:15:03.833
Dedenne should be able to sense them. I think.

266
00:15:03.900 --> 00:15:06.733
Oh, wow! Science is so amazing!

267
00:15:06.800 --> 00:15:08.466
Let’s give it a try.

268
00:15:08.533 --> 00:15:12.233
- Uh, may I get your assistance, Pikachu?
- Pika.

269
00:15:12.300 --> 00:15:14.300
We’re counting on you.

270
00:15:14.366 --> 00:15:16.366
You can do it, Pikachu.

271
00:15:18.199 --> 00:15:21.099
Now, we’re all set. Your turn, Ash.

272
00:15:21.166 --> 00:15:24.133
Hm. All right, Pikachu, use Thunderbolt!

273
00:15:24.199 --> 00:15:27.333
Pikachu!

274
00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:34.099
Here we go, then. And fire!

275
00:15:42.566 --> 00:15:44.733
Na! Na-na!

276
00:15:44.800 --> 00:15:47.733
Huh? Where are you going? Wait!

277
00:15:47.800 --> 00:15:50.333
- Hm.
- What’s wrong?

278
00:15:50.400 --> 00:15:53.766
I think it needs more power to function correctly.

279
00:15:53.833 --> 00:15:55.966
All right, Pikachu, give it more power.

280
00:15:56.033 --> 00:16:00.199
Pikachu!

281
00:16:00.266 --> 00:16:02.099
Are you sure this is safe?

282
00:16:02.166 --> 00:16:04.933
Don’t worry about it. Science can do anything.

283
00:16:05.000 --> 00:16:06.699
Okay, Pikachu, keep it up.

284
00:16:06.766 --> 00:16:10.966
Pikachu! Pika!

285
00:16:13.000 --> 00:16:15.000
Oh!

286
00:16:18.099 --> 00:16:20.699
-Pika.

287
00:16:20.766 --> 00:16:24.266
- Yup, I knew it.
- It went boom, too.

288
00:16:24.333 --> 00:16:27.166
Oh, no. To think it was working perfectly.

289
00:16:27.233 --> 00:16:30.900
Looks like we’re going to have to search for the little girl on foot again.

290
00:16:30.966 --> 00:16:33.300
- I guess so.
- Pichu.

291
00:16:33.366 --> 00:16:36.766
- Huh?
- Pichu!

292
00:16:36.833 --> 00:16:38.199
Pichu!

293
00:16:38.266 --> 00:16:41.199
Pichu. Thank goodness. Ah!

294
00:16:41.266 --> 00:16:43.800
- Ah! Where did Lyn go?
- Pichu!

295
00:16:43.866 --> 00:16:45.833
- Um, are you...?
- Huh?

296
00:16:45.900 --> 00:16:48.566
I remember you from the Pokémon Center.

297
00:16:48.633 --> 00:16:51.166
Hold on. Does that mean you’re Pichu’s Trainer?

298
00:16:52.266 --> 00:16:56.666
Yes, I am. My name’s Lena. Were you the ones who found Pichu?

299
00:16:56.733 --> 00:16:59.000
I’m not sure if found is the right word.

300
00:16:59.066 --> 00:17:02.699
- Dedenne! Where is Dedenne?
- Huh?

301
00:17:05.433 --> 00:17:09.066
Dedenne? It’s probably with Lyn, my little sister.

302
00:17:09.133 --> 00:17:11.599
Well, okay. Where is she?

303
00:17:11.666 --> 00:17:14.800
- Honestly, I don’t know.
- Huh?

304
00:17:14.866 --> 00:17:16.500
So, what happened?

305
00:17:16.566 --> 00:17:18.866
Lyn probably realized she had the wrong bag.

306
00:17:18.933 --> 00:17:20.933
I would think she’s looking for Pichu now.

307
00:17:21.000 --> 00:17:23.466
I see, but you don’t know where, right?

308
00:17:23.533 --> 00:17:27.033
I don’t. I’ve been looking for her everywhere I can think.

309
00:17:27.099 --> 00:17:29.399
For all I know she might have left town.

310
00:17:29.466 --> 00:17:32.233
We’ve got to get moving and find her right away.

311
00:17:32.300 --> 00:17:36.233
Right. I think we should all split up and search the widest area we can.

312
00:17:36.300 --> 00:17:39.266
- Yeah. Let’s give it all we’ve got.
- Pika!

313
00:17:39.333 --> 00:17:43.899
Where are you going? Slow down, please! Huh?

314
00:17:46.233 --> 00:17:48.266
I think the Pokémon Center’s that way.

315
00:17:55.733 --> 00:17:59.133
Now, where are we?

316
00:18:04.666 --> 00:18:11.733
Huh? Ah

317
00:18:11.800 --> 00:18:14.899
Hey, there you are!

318
00:18:14.966 --> 00:18:17.100
-Ah!

319
00:18:24.133 --> 00:18:27.333
Dedenne!

320
00:18:30.399 --> 00:18:33.899
-Awesome. You’re really, really strong.

321
00:18:33.966 --> 00:18:35.600
Na-na-na!

322
00:18:35.666 --> 00:18:38.133
-Huh?

323
00:18:41.966 --> 00:18:46.066
They’re chasing after us. What are we going to do?

324
00:18:46.133 --> 00:18:47.600
Oh, no.

325
00:18:50.266 --> 00:18:54.800
- Pi!
- Huh? Oh!

326
00:18:54.866 --> 00:18:56.666
Lyn!

327
00:18:57.800 --> 00:19:01.300
It’s Lena!

328
00:19:01.366 --> 00:19:04.500
- Lyn, are you okay?
- This Pokémon saved me, huh.

329
00:19:04.566 --> 00:19:08.233
I can’t believe that you came all this way by yourself.

330
00:19:08.300 --> 00:19:09.899
- I’m sorry.
- Pichu.

331
00:19:09.966 --> 00:19:11.500
Hi, Pichu. Heh-heh!

332
00:19:15.133 --> 00:19:17.233
- Pikachu.
- Ready, Dedenne?

333
00:19:17.300 --> 00:19:20.500
- All right, use Thunderbolt.
- Use Thunder Shock.

334
00:19:20.566 --> 00:19:23.000
- Pikachu!
- Pichu!

335
00:19:30.566 --> 00:19:33.933
- Yes! We did it!
- Yay, Dedenne!

336
00:19:36.466 --> 00:19:38.833
Ah!

337
00:19:43.666 --> 00:19:46.500
- I’m sorry.
- Now, everything’s all right.

338
00:19:46.566 --> 00:19:48.166
I’m so glad that you’re safe.

339
00:19:48.233 --> 00:19:51.366
Ah. Huh?

340
00:19:51.433 --> 00:19:55.233
Dedenne, I’m so sorry!

341
00:20:00.766 --> 00:20:02.399
Uh-oh.

342
00:20:03.500 --> 00:20:06.300
- I guess I’m sorry, too.
- Pika. Pikachu.

343
00:20:06.366 --> 00:20:08.833
Oh, Ash.

344
00:20:15.033 --> 00:20:17.566
All ready. Dig in, everyone.

345
00:20:17.633 --> 00:20:20.100
- It looks delicious.
- Thank you.

346
00:20:20.166 --> 00:20:23.100
Dedenne? Pichu? Aren’t you going to eat?

347
00:20:23.166 --> 00:20:26.600
- Na-na-na-na!
- Pichu!

348
00:20:26.666 --> 00:20:30.333
Stop right there, Lyn. Have you been giving out snacks again?

349
00:20:30.399 --> 00:20:33.533
- Bonnie. I told you.
- Huh?

350
00:20:36.466 --> 00:20:40.433
Happily, Dedenne is back with Bonnie and Pichu is back with Lyn.

351
00:20:40.500 --> 00:20:44.433
Another step in two young girls journey to one day become Trainers,

352
00:20:44.500 --> 00:20:47.899
as our heroes journey continues.
